            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Going Around 0.3.64

- Illness alerts now match the screen. The Monday summary names the trend as well as the level, for example "Flu Low, rising".
- The story label shows the level too, for example "Low · Rising".
- No "down to" alert while the illness is still rising.
- "Data through" in the footer now shows the week of the CDC data, not the measles feed's newer week.
]]></description>
